    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSXBSPnDQaaUW94aWPq7T-095QM.jpg"><p><span>The Dismantling of the Church of the Holy Innocents, 1785 </span></p><p><span>Hubert Robert 的废墟画</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft94zLtphqsKNxiq6QEP6jEXtVZU.jpg"><p><span>The Fire of the Paris Opera，1781</span></p><p><span>Hubert Robert 画的巴黎剧院着火</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDBx6dXjp3msGJfGQYOWYH2jm6b.jpg"><p><span>The Bastille During the First Days of its Demolition, 1789</span></p><p><span>Hubert Robert 画的巴士底狱拆除</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl8KPz8flOdLbGKltGWX5PNFmi9z.jpg"><p><span>La Démolition des Maisons sur le Pont au Change, 1788</span></p><p><span>Hubert Robert 画的Le pont au change 桥上房屋拆除</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_7Irh-anMf5BZBqBsUDxdwbFGN.jpeg"><p><span>英国 Hagely Park 里的假废墟</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwnapUMXilcKkWnXob4UZ0MvNz7.jpeg"><p><span>英国Painshill Park里的假废墟</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrewNr2y6YiD6LLDRkm3EaPmRunw.jpg"><p><span>Conical Intersect，1975，Gordon Matta-Clark</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqYbSZEu4kTFI7cXz_bT02bmW3v9.jpg"><p><span>Conical Intersect，1975，Gordon Matta-Clark</span></p><p></p><p><span>巫鸿，</span><em><span>废墟的故事：中国美术和视觉文化中的“在场”与“缺席”</span></em></p><p><span>Daniel Abramson, </span><em><span>Obsolescence: An Architectural History</span></em></p><p></p>]]></description>
