  <item>
    <title>S02E09 大象滑梯｜你的童年我的童年好像都一样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac4f01ee742e36efcbef727</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac4f01ee742e36efcbef727</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 13:01:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZrHGpfinD27j_CEhN1fEmJe5Fq.jpg"><p><span>Vladimir Georgiev 拍摄的1950年车里雅宾斯克儿童公园</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp5ytOBzEn6dFcaCW80HCbAvq83F.jpg"><p><span>柏林东德时期的火箭游乐设施</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlNybA0hGkx2BmnBfO8R1vw5Hbx3.jpg"><p><span>斯洛伐克住宅区里1979年的UFO游戏雕塑</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4rX6w9g2nPuoQTgOCi8k9P21M3.jpeg"><p><span>Zupgrafika出版的 Soviet Playgrounds</span></p><p><a href="https://www.zupagrafika.com/shop/soviet-playgrounds" data-url="https://www.zupagrafika.com/shop/soviet-playgrounds"><span>www.zupagrafika.com</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2x5KSCzH-K4_SrqMI4vbiFM68V.jpg"><p><span>Otto Leibe在Halle Neustadt 哈勒新城设计的大象滑梯</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtrJNM0bLJ9LEQtZp8-VO29P8LNm.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpl9PB06KsKNmvCGY_kzBUNwD51t.jpg"><p><span>德累斯顿标准化设计的大象滑梯</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvOjnmZx_qDahvn1DlRCywSzQpcW.jpeg"><p><span>Egon Møller-Nielsen 设计的'Tufsen' (以他女儿的小名命名)</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuP8_SiUFqrb0Z06VekTrFWZ6TOT.jpg"><p><span> Egon Møller-Nielsen 设计的'</span><a class="zReHs" href="https://www.stockholmkonst.se/konst/agget" data-url="https://www.stockholmkonst.se/konst/agget"><span>Ägget</span></a><span>' (蛋）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpu4UnVuh2iMtvp03HdrhkygKGWG.jpg"><p><span>Aldo van Eyck设计的阿姆斯特丹游乐场</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2GRp36kRFS4P3BhWNjkDq5dyu6.jpg"><p><span>Aldo van Eyck设计的阿姆斯特丹游乐场</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKVscvVE8ZfSyf68ZGpRthovRH-.jpg"><p><span>Aldo van Eyck 设计的攀爬架</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fni6LGfvL2nc5kUhfTV62FcZGFyb.webp"><p><span>Carl Theodor Sørensen 的‘junk playground'</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpen3hXQBp77y0z1WusOCKX7Izzj.jpg"><p><span>受到Carl Theodor Sørensen启发在英国出现的Adventure Playground</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpIAWXfFWyfxk6MqdSdEMTRxiEez.jpeg"><p><span>Isamu Noguchi 野口勇设计的play mountain</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvpT1GyWkTvDCsAsw37GTmvdkiDp.jpg"><p><span>Isamu Noguchi为UN总部设计的儿童游乐场</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYyOPRE3epzw5kNdBti1zQcfYww.jpg"><p><span>MOMA举行Playground Sculpture竞赛</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVUqhXR_xSykVqX8zT0CoHN6F-C.jpg"><p><span>天山儿童交通公园</span></p><p></p><p><span>豆瓣大象滑梯小组 </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/group/745373/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/group/745373/"><span>www.douban.com</span></a></p><p><span>发现了一个关于游乐建筑设计的不错的网站 </span><a href="https://architekturfuerkinder.ch/kuenstler-kollektive/" data-url="https://architekturfuerkinder.ch/kuenstler-kollektive/"><span>architekturfuerkinder.ch</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
