    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogHy3hlWCtMUbeCYYao_i6wjECi.jpg"><p><span>1860年伯尔尼火车站</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6JQwzTY9vEtuEAXDTZVoPGgQSV.jpg"><p><span>伯尔尼钟楼</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQbm60AH8a0YjYi2FkdDVU3RUVr.jpg"><p><span>William Frith, The Railway Station, 1862</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp5NwpbSmO0OS0u6gSpaUDdq63oQ.jpg"><p><span>Manet, </span><em><span>The Railway</span></em><span> (</span><em><span>Gare Saint-Lazare),</span></em><span> 1873</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtX9_XOwHkFVTXwHDSBB3A-UmrK-.jpg"><p><span>Gustave Caillebotte, Le Pont de l'Europe, 1876</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizYwLD_xIqT7sOThLfHzjowkdP5.jpg"><p><span>Gustave Caillebotte, Le Pont de l'Europe, 1876</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvewgbXfxVo8NbuCc3MTqSTXYXhW.jpg"><p><span>Claude Monet, Le Gare Saint-Lazare, 1877</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9uOksK3jrGnoTEGNaZWmADkkfQ.jpg"><p><span>Claude Monet, Le Gare Saint-Lazare, 1877</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8GyHcoiIj9WiijtzPiyhbIqgWk.jpg"><p><span>由Jacob Frederik Klinkhamer设计的约翰内斯堡车站</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7KXgkegAxIbrHBWEIJSozGVmSE.jpeg"><p><span>约翰内斯堡车站现状</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuq92Nqdx3pq6Tk7J_tOoai-Bhyc.jpg"><p><span>Penn Station历史照片</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4o2E8sN0J3ckpdpf_wW8Zb2sKS.jpg"><p><span>抗议Penn Station拆除的游行</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVe7dYxMDVAsq88cMYVApww7eoB.jpg"><p><span>参与抗议游行的Jane Jacobs</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLZ1LYkGHLkJhO0CfYDb8VEUB9e.jpg"><p><span>Penn Station 拆除之后建造的Madison Square Garden</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsLccCVno6LR9rxSQm4YfJm3BOil.jpg"><p><span>今天的Grand Central Station</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7-hjEreuLtEGr0xxHEOaWmcWb-.jpg"><p><span>安特卫普火车站</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frg5QD5vKmw1O6UdsMKeVgxvXx_d.webp"><p><span>荷兰火车站的自行车</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftq77-TzUBeRK7TseqHsXUqSduE9.jpg"><p><span>MAD 嘉兴火车站 </span><a href="https://www.archdaily.com/zh/1013479/jia-xing-huo-che-zhan-mad-architects" data-url="https://www.archdaily.com/zh/1013479/jia-xing-huo-che-zhan-mad-architects"><span>www.archdaily.com</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>Peter Galison, </span><em><span>Einstein's Clocks, Poincare's Maps: Empires of Time</span></em><span>, 2003.</span></p><p><span>沃尔夫冈•希弗尔布施（Wolfgang Schivelbusch），</span><em><span>铁道之旅 19世纪空间与时间的工业化</span></em><span>，2018</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
