    <title>S02E07 下水道｜巴黎下水道的老鼠让我热泪盈眶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaf0c400916f6f8b445ee1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaf0c400916f6f8b445ee1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:45:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoaVZz6nv4w0Gy4osaOxmR5TT3WL.jpg"><p><span>河南平粮台古城遗址出土的陶制管道</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhhZSjv7kJzV64U5m44CkY97s5BH.jpg"><p><span>Monster Soup Commonly Called Thames Water, 1828</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcZ-vrhOo7ejRo2LxKorwZmK-GD.jpg"><p><span>Bazalgette设计的新下水道管网 直接通向泰晤士河下游</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLj2wkjoA4jO6-eaUFkjQ1tanrF.png"><p><span>Bazalgette设计的蛋形下水道剖面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqyVO8XtUz3gTGRlboRogleMmUyr.jpg"><p><span>伦敦下水道建设的历史照片</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqo1jtAyjQdpVfdYE0eCIO5Pjo8C.jpg"><p><span>Abbey Mills Pumping Station 伦敦下水道泵站</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm414GSHUhKS8vMq2gFJYphuNueZ.jpg"><p><span>参观巴黎下水道的插画</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKfCpnYR0zNxbcHYJaAV7h5Mp9b.png"><p><span>巴黎奥运会开幕式短篇中下水道的镜头</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnZ5ahL6OW5aYEQbOD8DfFRLU8jN.png"><p><span>费城的Dock Creek</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsNUOI48v0JxLI6KECBueTI4k304.png"><p><span>今天的Dock Street</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgA6xlsX0nsPjqjPG28o5P2NrDs7.jpg"><p><span>Mill Creek 被改造成下水道的历史照片</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZ93HGJ_Mcj37nA9vfJW3rdA1-i.jpeg"><p><span>Mill Creek 地区路面塌陷的历史照片</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgm8b811L2LjAKZkZTnNYCPJbPR5.jpg"><p><span>Mill Creek 地区房屋倒塌的历史照片</span></p><p></p><p><span>《下水道：地下城市折叠史》</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36437515/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36437515/"><span>book.douban.com</span></a></p><h1><span>Maria Kaika,&nbsp;Erik Swyngedouw. </span><strong><span>Fetishizing the modern city: the phantasmagoria of urban technological networks. </span></strong><a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/1468-2427.00239" data-url="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/1468-2427.00239"><span>onlinelibrary.wiley.com</span></a></h1><p><span>West Philadelphia Landscape Project: </span><a href="https://wplp.net" data-url="https://wplp.net"><span>wplp.net</span></a></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
