  <item>
    <title>S02E06 街道｜为什么道路都是网格状的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa721f9492687f6aad956e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa721f9492687f6aad956e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 22:47:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseH1QjFYETo1qPqJApedfh94o_S.jpg"><p><span>《周礼•考工记》 “匠人营国，方九里，旁三门。国中九经九纬，经涂九轨。左祖右社，面朝后市”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnJl3O8XQpZWIsA_dM9fvr0N8Xc_.jpg"><h1><span>土耳其Priene考古遗址，显示出古希腊希波达莫斯网格规划</span></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMPYXm9ZjaHr9kElJarhFdvkC6n.png"><h1><span>古罗马网格式街道规划</span></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtghhjF5P2EcaKHoPalwqH4YMsDK.jpg"><h1><span> 巴黎奥斯曼规划对路网的影响</span></h1><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi59LWVBMglk5THCkSwX8ZIEN8FR.jpg"><p><span>1789年柏林地图 西南部的Friedrichstadt有清晰的网格路网</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYUDu51x6P0jlaw8S7fMnb0NsyB.jpeg"><p><span>柏林1862年Holbrecht Plan规划的路网</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspYd-KM9vNmPgX-JAdvV8hMEsXU.jpg"><p><span>希特勒规划的Welthauptstadt Germania轴线</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOvyN9TK-QPpWVPT0KmoGd0y7Xd.jpg"><p><span>现存的混凝土墩</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgn58vh83TPG7JclVwUQrwZpT4UL.jpg"><p><span>东柏林Stalinallee（今天的Karl Marx Allee）规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FolC-CQERfhBBCigHduekcsOA5oF.jpg"><p><span>西柏林Hansaviertel规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liqVRZwbbWI7LFSSznLsDfGdRtCt.jpg"><p><span>天津九国租界地图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_fvEK7yIVmgZycSFCZg5-Bwk0R.webp"><p><span>Timgad的古罗马网格规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiYSKdL-TAhk7h9LoNZ_o2Zmr4ee.jpg"><p><span>1767年利马规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQCsxyRwxbX7DM_byHaS5jswE7_.jpg"><p><span>1713年布宜诺斯艾利斯规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frl32EObk5mjo_3tO-rxufsuE3AY.jpg"><p><span>1712年圣地亚哥规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkxi_jEnenG3kl5jenF0qlfn9ppo.jpg"><p><span>1638年纽黑文规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmrfXP8enVNcaQm8OqraApfKEpyT.jpg"><p><span>John Randel绘制的曼哈顿勘测地图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEByiEEmEiqpNvH5thhcnr8BNlD.jpg"><p><span>今天纽约中央公园Randel留下的勘测定点铁桩，标记着一个规划的路口</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFbWU-r5cJ58r3M0PQkSCILZK5b.jpg"><p><span>柯布西耶1925年的Plan Voisin，针对巴黎中心的改造方案</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSoHr2pJoDvnyzuyN4SPfGPQoB1.webp"><p><span>柯布西耶 1922年 300万人口现代城市的规划，架空的高速交通路网是核心</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9UVetjiY25aLVWfseoFVMc18LB.jpg"><p><span>昌迪加尔规划</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghijrcGeWitBsnLlzv5qXh0crQ9.png"><p><span>Alison and Peter Smithson, 1953, Urban Re-identification Grid</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUdFtatYIKrHFfEXcWXYsqprJEI.jpg"><p><span>Alison and Peter Smithson, Golden Lane Housing设计，“Streets in the air”空中街道</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjpwnP8GAam2UoeWglu4ckBRgDSh.jpg"><p><span>Alison and Peter Smithson, 1966, Robin Hood Gardens.</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FthBA7tFUb0kTuWMwy6p-4TO-eu2.jpg"><p><span>Jane Jacobs</span></p><p></p><p><span>James Scott. </span><em><span>Seeing like a State</span></em><span>. 1998</span></p><p><span>Jane Jacobs. The Death and Life of Great American Cities. 1961</span></p><p><span>Amy Zhang et al. Wanghong Urbanism: Towards a New Urban-digital Spectacle. </span><a href="https://www.mediapolisjournal.com/2022/11/wanghong-urbanism/" data-url="https://www.mediapolisjournal.com/2022/11/wanghong-urbanism/"><span>www.mediapolisjournal.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
