    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>巴黎在拱廊街鼎盛时期有150多条，至今仍有30多条保留下来：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpglYZh3_tedpNh4OCQ0Ic1bVres.jpg"><p><span>Galerie Vivienne, Paris, 1826年落成</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgtFjaAFyXBORkVMfh4SbJRmTrUk.jpg"><p><span>Passage des Panoramas, Paris. 建于1799年。</span></p><p></p><p><span>其它欧洲城市也有拱廊街</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiASZoPfewMADTDYcz-_WDBT2ZR9.jpg"><p><span>Royal Gallery of Saint-Hubert, Brussels. 是欧洲最古老的拱廊街之一，长200米，1847年落成。</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubYqpZM5iAvDNsqOZH0ROwwPR3K.jpg"><p><span>巴黎乐篷百货le bon marché 中庭</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGdpToEQos_54cuPcq_ImXccv5O.jpg"><p><span>1900年左右纽约的商业街(14th Street and Sixth Avenue)，被称为“ladies' mile”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrEhScPLpKMJh4SwE7OyZVlXHL-.jpg"><p><span>上海民国时期的百货公司</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpgMGu7lEN0XMoNJR3i6hH4iNl_o.jpg"><p><span>新新百货公司店铺说明</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtHgEqjsz7XU1AlD3YGshGPiFkFn.jpeg"><p><span>Victor Gruen 维克多 格鲁恩（1903-1980）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2fu8zrqQMKuP9lrXoR3vIpVCl9.jpeg"><p><span>Victor Gruen设计的Southdale Center商场内部空间</span></p><p></p><p><span>Charles Baudelaire, </span><em><span>The Painter of Modern Life</span></em></p><p><span>Walter Benjamin,</span><em><span> The Arcade Project</span></em></p><p><span>Rem Koolhaas, </span><em><span>Junkspace</span></em></p><p></p>]]></description>
