  <item>
    <title>S01E10 过去的单身女性住哪里？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ac84dd5b2d0ed069d8511a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ac84dd5b2d0ed069d8511a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Mar 2026 20:17:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>荷兰中世纪的贝居安院</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>英国工业革命后兴起的女性住房</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Gertrude Leverkus是谁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>德国法兰克福的女性住房</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Koos Pot是谁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Edith Farnsworth是谁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>广东顺德的自梳女与冰玉堂</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2yp4rK7mf4YqFf-e5v7TRjiZnY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿姆斯特丹的一处贝安居院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoyOdU9wwHGcsrrxCeNKYQJUAVnf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Ada Lewis House, Joseph and Smithem, 1913, &nbsp;London</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5SDOKF3RjeQr3KvqVuqMCNWx67.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>伦敦斯隆花园住宅内部，由妇女联合住宅公司于1888年创立，为约150名女性提供了住房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjA4AEUz_cIb3PTEpmylNUlcoyLo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Gertrude Leverkus(1898-1989)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnSxlZbEPWpymposDLk68RQ4PxEF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Gertrude Leverkus 的改建设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuErlw2gIO6upiSccT4E4kwJTImc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Gertrude Leverkus 设计的厨房橱柜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-TTAUfOAZO8wWhVokYAqv6VuTC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Margarete Schütte-Lihotzky (1897-2000)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtIbF1-4uSoKpFiVxEoFRUg--_b2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Margarete Schütte-Lihotzky 设计的一种单身女性住宅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2LRhuEm-2ZQo9wrIxOjNAIuYlF.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Oranjehof 女性住宅，</span><a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacoba_Froukje_Keegstra" data-url="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacoba_Froukje_Keegstra"><span>Koos Pot-Keegstra</span></a><span> and </span><a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joop_Pot?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" data-url="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joop_Pot?action=edit&amp;redlink=1"><span>Joop Pot</span></a><span>, 1939-1940, 荷兰阿姆斯特丹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSq58qLdvFzrFKu3W9u1xMw2ZBV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>范斯沃思住宅Farnsworth House, Mies van der Rohe, 1951，美国伊利诺伊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWaXhAJzd2PTfxnfreH0TUq1w9y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Edith Farnsworth</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlwHsxaJ1RDxRCNG6pNPkmOnineO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在1947年MOMA展出Farnsworth House</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoO-uHejTxS9XPQJNE4LAjcqgcJP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>广东顺德冰玉堂，1950</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/69513be2dcb70824dfc47912/liajOQSKVe6BQe1HZPMmRx2v0s1l.m4a" length="31498489" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqW-YVGRDDQ5jGE11fkz5jk_x7N1.png"/>
